{"date":"2026-11-28T09:57:33Z","photos":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/%E8%8D%89%E6%B2%B3%E8%A1%97%E9%81%93%E8%80%81%E9%BB%91%E5%B1%B1.jpg/960px-%E8%8D%89%E6%B2%B3%E8%A1%97%E9%81%93%E8%80%81%E9%BB%91%E5%B1%B1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8D%89%E6%B2%B3%E8%A1%97%E9%81%93%E8%80%81%E9%BB%91%E5%B1%B1.jpg","a":"Wei Wang","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"Mount Laohei is located at the northernmost part of Caohe Subdistrict, which serves as a natural dividing point of Dapu, Caohe and Jiguansha"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/%E7%9F%B3%E5%A4%B4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80.jpg/960px-%E7%9F%B3%E5%A4%B4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%9F%B3%E5%A4%B4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80.jpg","a":"Df4d0095","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​石城原名石头城。明代新安堡城墙均为大块石头所筑，故称石头城，后逐渐演变为石城至今。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/%E4%B8%9C%E6%B1%A4%E5%9C%A3%E6%B3%89%E5%AF%BA.jpg/960px-%E4%B8%9C%E6%B1%A4%E5%9C%A3%E6%B3%89%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%9C%E6%B1%A4%E5%9C%A3%E6%B3%89%E5%AF%BA.jpg","a":"Wei Wang","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​东汤镇温泉资源得天独厚。东汤温泉发现于唐朝，距今已有1300多年的历史。温泉水的日涌出量达2900余吨，水温高达78℃，以其水疗效果极佳享有盛名。清乾隆皇帝曾亲笔御书“圣泉第一”，当地百姓修筑庙宇“圣泉寺”以示纪念，并在庙门以“圣泉第一”为横额配成了一幅绝妙的对联，上联为“人间"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/%E7%AE%A1%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%9C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E7%9B%96%E5%A2%93.jpg/960px-%E7%AE%A1%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%9C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E7%9B%96%E5%A2%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%AE%A1%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%9C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E7%9B%96%E5%A2%93.jpg","a":"Wei Wang","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​东山大石盖墓位于辽宁省凤城市草河街道管家村西赫家堡。大石盖墓大致呈三部分分布：一在山丘顶部，一在山下的坡地，一在东山西侧约1000米的西山。墓与墓之问相距约4—7米，分布面积约5000平方米。"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/%E5%87%A4%E5%9F%8E%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%AD_-_Fengcheng_No.2_Middle_School_-_2011.05_-_panoramio.jpg/960px-%E5%87%A4%E5%9F%8E%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%AD_-_Fengcheng_No.2_Middle_School_-_2011.05_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%87%A4%E5%9F%8E%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%AD_-_Fengcheng_No.2_Middle_School_-_2011.05_-_panoramio.jpg","a":"rheins","l":"CC BY 3.0","t":"凤城二中 - Fengcheng No.2 Middle School - 2011.05"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/%E6%96%B0%E5%87%A4%E5%87%B0%E6%A1%A5_-_New_Phoenix_Bridge_-_2011.05_-_panoramio.jpg/960px-%E6%96%B0%E5%87%A4%E5%87%B0%E6%A1%A5_-_New_Phoenix_Bridge_-_2011.05_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%96%B0%E5%87%A4%E5%87%B0%E6%A1%A5_-_New_Phoenix_Bridge_-_2011.05_-_panoramio.jpg","a":"rheins","l":"CC BY 3.0","t":"新凤凰桥 - New Phoenix Bridge - 2011.05"}]}